  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AZE Council of Europe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AZE Europar&#xe5;det</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Council of Europe will together with the Prosecutor&apos;s General Office implement a training programme for prosecutors in human rights with focus on EU&apos;s conventions on human rights. The project will be a training of trainers project and approximately 600 prosecutors will be trained during the project time (there are about 1000 prosecutors in Azerbaijan).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Europar&#xe5;det ska tillsammans med Prosecutor&apos;s General Office genomf&#xf6;ra en utbildning f&#xf6;r &#xe5;klagare i m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter med fokus p&#xe5; EUs konventioner om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. Utbildningen kommer att ske i s k &quot;training of trainers&quot;-format, med huvudfokus p&#xe5; en mindre grupp &quot;tr&#xe4;nare&quot;. Ca 600 av &#xe5;klagarna (det finns ca 1000) kommer att genomg&#xe5; utbildningen inom ramen f&#xf6;r projektet.</narrative>
  </description>
